<h2>Hello {{candidate_name}},</h2>

<p>There is an update on your submitted grievance (Case #<strong>{{grievance_id}}</strong>).</p>

<div class="info-box">
  <p><strong>Case ID:</strong> #{{grievance_id}}</p>
  <p><strong>Category:</strong> {{category}}</p>
  <p><strong>Status:</strong> <span class="badge badge-warning">{{status}}</span></p>
  {{#if resolution_notes}}
  <p><strong>Resolution Details:</strong> {{resolution_notes}}</p>
  {{/if}}
</div>

<p>Your safety and workplace wellbeing are our top priorities. You can review the full status and reply to the grievance team on your Candidate Support dashboard.</p>

<p>Best regards,<br><strong>The Even Cargo Grievance Redressal Team</strong></p>
